stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> pending: bracket created
    pending --> commit: both players known
    commit --> reveal: 2 valid commitments
    commit --> done: commit deadline, only one committed
    commit --> commit: deadline, nobody committed (new round)
    reveal --> commit: both revealed, tie (round += 1)
    reveal --> done: both revealed, winner
    reveal --> done: invalid opening (cheater forfeits)
    reveal --> done: reveal deadline (non-revealer forfeits)
    done --> [*]
